  "_comment": "Third-party viewer libraries for STANDALONE review bundles only (never served to the MCP App iframe). An entry with a `url` is hosted, unmodified, on the dingduff-public `viewer-vendor` branch and pinned by commit: build_review.py writes its url+sha256 into the bundle, and the viewer downloads it when a PDF or Word source is opened and refuses to run it unless the sha256 matches. An entry without a `url` is a local file under this directory; build_review.py checks its sha256 before embedding it. To upgrade a library: commit the pinned upstream file to the viewer-vendor branch, repoint url (new commit) + version + sha256 here, and re-run the skill's pytest suite.",
